#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0352-A expect=noViolation domain=SJ
#note "SJUPDES is present, so the presence requirement is met and this sister is silent regardless of its VALUES - an empty SJUPDES on an UNPLAN record is the PARENT rule's finding, not this one. Negative control for the split."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset SJ label="Subject Stages" class="SPECIAL PURPOSE"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SJSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col SJUPDES type=Char label="Unplanned Stage Description"
---
S1 | SJ | 001 | 1 | UNPLAN | Unscheduled interim stage
